RS_api --> RS_eventing
RS_api --> RS_security
RS_api --> RS_tracking_service
RS_api --> RS_intercept_service
RS_api --> RS_analytics
RS_collab --> RS_model
RS_collab --> RS_eventing
RS_collab --> RS_command
RS_collab --> RS_security
RS_observability --> RS_model
RS_replay --> RS_model
